WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.011
In this tutorial, we'll prepare your first MultiTier
Discounts offer without turning it on before you're

2
00:00:06.011 --> 00:00:13.149
ready. Our example is simple: buy two Cobalt notebooks
and save ten percent, or buy three and save fifteen

3
00:00:13.149 --> 00:00:19.159
percent. We'll choose the right plan, identify the
storefront setup, and save an inactive campaign. A

4
00:00:19.159 --> 00:00:22.165
separate tutorial walks through the actual cart tests.

5
00:00:23.215 --> 00:00:30.971
Open MultiTier Discounts from your Shopify Admin, then
go to Plans and Billing. Start with the features your

6
00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:37.004
offer needs. Free supports a small core percentage
quantity-break setup within its active-campaign limit.

7
00:00:37.004 --> 00:00:42.606
More advanced execution, targeting and gift options
depend on the plan shown here.

8
00:00:42.956 --> 00:00:48.881
The MTD Plus plan and Shopify Plus are different
subscriptions. Supported checkout mystery presentation

9
00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:57.345
requires an eligible Shopify Plus store as well as the
app feature. You do not need to choose Plus simply

10
00:00:57.345 --> 00:01:03.694
because your store uses Shopify Plus. Always review
Shopify's actual price and billing terms before

11
00:01:03.694 --> 00:01:05.387
approving a paid subscription.

12
00:01:06.437 --> 00:01:12.911
Now identify the theme you're testing. A visible
widget explains the offer; the campaign controls its

13
00:01:12.911 --> 00:01:18.980
discount rules. For our product example, we'll later
add Quantity Tiers to the product template.

14
00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:25.691
Gift Auto-Add appears separately under app embeds. It
supports eligible gift behavior and is not the same

15
00:01:25.691 --> 00:01:32.800
thing as a visible quantity widget. You don't need to
enable every block or embed for this first example.

16
00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:38.039
Keep advanced cart selectors at their defaults until
you have a specific theme problem.

17
00:01:39.089 --> 00:01:46.050
Return to All Campaigns and create a new campaign.
Choose Tiered discount. In Offer, give it a

18
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:51.783
recognizable name and choose automatic execution with
a percentage reward. In Conditions, choose Quantity

19
00:01:51.783 --> 00:01:57.925
Breaks and select only the Cobalt notebook. Leaving
this product list empty broadens the scope.

20
00:01:58.275 --> 00:02:05.014
In Rewards, set the two-unit minimum to ten percent
and the three-unit minimum to fifteen percent. If you

21
00:02:05.014 --> 00:02:12.503
began with a recipe, check all prefilled values and
remove any tiers you do not intend to use. These are

22
00:02:12.503 --> 00:02:16.621
quantities on a qualifying cart line, not second- and
third-product positions.

23
00:02:17.671 --> 00:02:24.942
Open Review and launch. Read the product scope, both
tiers, schedule and combination rules. In Quantity and

24
00:02:24.942 --> 00:02:31.357
Sorting, set Maximum discounted quantity per product
to zero, meaning unlimited, so every qualifying unit

25
00:02:31.357 --> 00:02:38.628
receives the rate. Check the store timezone before
adding dates. For this first save, choose Save as

26
00:02:38.628 --> 00:02:39.483
inactive draft.

27
00:02:39.833 --> 00:02:46.490
After saving, reopen the campaign and check that the
selected product and both tiers are still correct.

28
00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:53.146
Closing an advanced panel does not clear its values.
Preview can help explain the configuration, but it

29
00:02:53.146 --> 00:02:56.670
cannot replace a real cart and Shopify checkout test.

30
00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:03.536
At eighteen dollars per notebook, our expected
merchandise totals are eighteen dollars for one,

31
00:03:03.536 --> 00:03:10.182
thirty-two dollars and forty cents for two, and
forty-five dollars and ninety cents for three. Those

32
00:03:10.182 --> 00:03:16.412
figures exclude tax, shipping and other discounts.
Check your actual product price before using them.

33
00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:23.673
Test below each threshold, at the threshold, and after
removing items. Check an unrelated product too. Keep

34
00:03:23.673 --> 00:03:29.770
the campaign inactive until you're ready for that
controlled test. The next tutorial shows the

35
00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:35.054
quantity-break setup and how to compare the expected
calculation with the real result.
